  "scope": "core/api/ContentAPI.kt and the other core/api files listed in `unchanged` compiled unchanged on JDK 11 with Kotlin 1.8.20 and the published ConstLib 1.4.28, together with the original Location, Script, Clocks, Globals, TickUtils, DiaryLevel, ForceMoveCtx, Quests and StorableFamily. Original text inserted into adapters at generation time: Skills.SKILL_NAME and the skill ids, Direction.getDirection(int, int) and the QuestRequirements table. Everything else is a recording adapter answering from the case: every member of Player, Entity, NPC, Item, Scenery and the containers, managers, dispatchers, definitions, registries, timers, scripts, pulses and content objects ContentAPI reaches. Item, Scenery and Animation construction is recorded; varp maps, clocks, script fields, charges and the poison timer are case state, snapshotted after the call. Each case runs in a class loader of its own; follow-up steps run the recorded pulses, queued scripts and skill dialogue callbacks. Calls made while a class initialises are not recorded.",
